<%# Shown in a post's or page's editor header when the record is readable
    but not editable (access-control design spec §5 "Everywhere"): its
    fields are disabled and autosave isn't attached. `data-view-only` is
    the hook tests find it by. %>
<span data-view-only class="inline-flex items-center rounded-cs border border-dashed border-line-strong bg-sunken px-2 py-0.5 text-sm text-meta">View only</span>
